            "enable_text_shadow": false,
            "title": "<h2>Tubing sizes and options</h2>",
            "description": "<p>Our hoops are measured by the OD (outer diameter of the hoop). This measures across the widest part of the hoop including the width of the tubing.</p><p>Our expertly handcrafted LED hoops come in 3/4″ and 5/8″ OD tubing in both HDPE and Polypro.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/polypro-hoops\" title=\"PolyPro Hoops\"><strong>Polypro day hoops</strong></a> come in numerous colors, in both 3/4″ and 5/8″ OD!</p><p><a href=\"/collections/beginner-hoops\" title=\"Beginner Hoops\"><strong>Beginner Hoops</strong></a> are made of 1″ OD tubing.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/fire-hoops\" title=\"Fire Hoops\"><strong>Fire Hoops</strong></a> come in 3/4″ of 5/8″ HDPE, but can also upgrade your Fire Hoop to color polypro tubing!</p>",
